2026-07-27T08:37:49.5425965Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:37:49.5426708Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:37:49.5427737Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:37:49.5429055Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:37:49.5429788Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
